#[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(2.12)")
 $ H^0 \( C \, \( k + 1 \) L \) arrow.r H^0 \( Z \, \( \( k + 1 \) L \) \|_Z \) $ <curve:evaluation-surjectivity>]

 is surjective.]
